sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser as React client
    participant Studio as Streamlit
    participant Worker as Pipecat worker
    participant Store as SQLite store

    User->>Studio: Select active pipeline
    Studio-->>Browser: Worker URL and pipeline ID
    Browser->>Worker: POST /start
    Worker->>Store: Load and revalidate graph
    Worker->>Store: Create running session
    Worker-->>Browser: SmallWebRTC connection data
    User->>Browser: Speak through microphone
    Browser->>Worker: Stream audio frames
    Worker->>Worker: Realtime or cascade pipeline
    Worker-->>Browser: Stream audio and RTVI events
    Worker->>Store: Append semantic events
    Browser-->>User: Play response and show transcript
